{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Walks</b> — on the way of the blameless, and the witness, and one of crooked ways, from the side of his crooked ways." "<b>Ways</b> — they are not only two, and the witness is באחת, that the bet is pointed with sheva, meaning in one of them."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:14.677945879Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}